# Q Continuum enters untapped with three other lands and its first mode pumps Llanowar Elves (+1/+1) and gives it
# vigilance, shown by the Elves attacking without tapping and dealing 2 (a 1/1 would deal 1) (CR 614.1d, 603.6a,
# 700.2b, 611.2a, 702.20, 508.1f).
# The Elves are the only creature, so they are the mode's only target; the checks run at the end so the attack
# declaration is not spent on a "?" line.

[Bot1 Deck]
Forest
Llanowar Elves
Island x2
Q Continuum
Island x15

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot1.Hand.Llanowar Elves.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
[T5 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
[T7 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Q Continuum.Play
Bot1.Modes(1)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[Bot1.BeginCombat]
Bot1.Attack(Llanowar Elves > Bot2)
[Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
